      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "paragraphId": "P2",
          "quote": "hence there arise laws and mutual covenants; and that which is ordained by law is termed by them lawful and just."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The student identifies the motive for social agreements (avoiding harm) but does not explicitly connect this summary to the broader prompt question regarding whether justice matters without practical advantages.",
      "uncertainty": "It is unknown if the student considers the desire to avoid harm a practical advantage or if they intend to contrast this with an internal moral value of justice.",
